# Vellum — white paper, neutral ink, one ochre accent. A hybrid: bg/fg/amber
# sampled from an Aaron Francis screenshot (white #ffffff, ink #1f2022, table
# headers #cb953d), grays from Tailwind's neutral scale, the chromatic ANSI
# slots from Tailwind's 700/600 steps (the same family tailwind-light draws on).
# Contrast calls: the sampled amber is 2.7:1 on white, so it is the *bright*
# yellow only (headers, badges); the normal yellow and the accent are the
# deeper ochre #9a6a18 (4.7:1). Slot 8 (zsh autosuggestion) is neutral-500
# #737373 (4.7:1). Cyan is cyan-800 #007595 because cyan-700 is 3.6:1 on white.
palette = 0=#1f2022
palette = 1=#c10007
